  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, the scholar chooses any one material imposition she knows; the scholar no longer needs to expend her martial focus for uses of this imposition, never provokes an attack of opportunity for activating it, and may activate it as a swift action. If the scholar chooses a material imposition that grants an explosive option, any bonus damage it deals and the save DC for flashbangs modified by it are determined as though the scholar’s class level were 4 levels higher than it actually is.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/scholar#toc63\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
